{
"file": 849,
"paths": [
"d008/d078/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "8a6e1382",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "794b1fc9",
"en_raw": "...What is it"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "ca5b9875",
"en_raw": "It's Murase and the others"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "55d99fb3",
"en_raw": "Second in the grade"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "e7bcd7f5",
"en_raw": "what are you doing in a place like this?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "a62eb08a",
"en_raw": "You're a sarcastic one"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "d715e09c",
"en_raw": "Number two is behind you, you know"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "2d70f6e4",
"en_raw": "That doesn't matter"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "966f7ed7",
"en_raw": "What I want to ask is..."
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "ad1f8b55",
"en_raw": "...Today's a breather"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "2d10e0ef",
"en_raw": "I've come here often since long ago"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "ddabea61",
"en_raw": "Since long ago, to do what?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "400841af",
"en_raw": "Huh, did I"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "d288d689",
"en_raw": "say something strange?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "c6337dac",
"en_raw": "Fishing, obviously"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "aa42468c",
"en_raw": "Hmm, even a serious guy"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "652eb5ec",
"en_raw": "used to fish"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "4f340e5d",
"en_raw": "When I had free time"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "1a00840a",
"en_raw": "By the way"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "4df3a4a1",
"en_raw": "do you know the camphor tree around here"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "a524dd13",
"en_raw": "that grants wishes?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "9c515849",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "3fb12c01",
"en_raw": "They say it's a tree where your wish"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "15ab354d",
"en_raw": "comes true at others' expense"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "78b1472a",
"en_raw": "...Kind of a nice story, no?"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "b4a6534b",
"en_raw": "How ridiculous..."
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "3b2b3994",
"en_raw": "Hey, wait"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "d15f6952",
"en_raw": "It's in there"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "fb4cd9e5",
"en_raw": "a lump of desire..."
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "f000f527",
"en_raw": "Take out / Leave it  Sango, stop it"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "7a5607a0",
"en_raw": "What's the harm"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "c18ca8fe",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "9253a877",
"en_raw": "Fine for Sango, but look"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "7ae45444",
"en_raw": "Shiina's here too..."
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "4b136f47",
"en_raw": "I don't mind, though"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "c51e1b82",
"en_raw": "It's astonishing, really"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "f479c599",
"en_raw": "How honest"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "36f081d9",
"en_raw": "you are with your own feelings"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "9be944ce",
"en_raw": "Put in a wish / Skip it..."
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "18271b34",
"en_raw": "...Forget it"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "20aed923",
"en_raw": "What am I doing"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "e08e2614",
"en_raw": "I..."
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "80e09182",
"en_raw": "Doing that"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "846aae73",
"en_raw": "only makes me more miserable..."
}
]
}